--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
On the GTK4 widgets
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

libshumate is mostly GtkWidget subclasses, and all of them are bound, because
the loader binds whatever the typelib describes rather than whatever somebody
got round to wrapping by hand. Constructing one still needs what GTK needs, a
display and a main loop, so the suite exercises the plain GObjects --
Shumate::Coordinate and Shumate::Viewport -- which need neither.
